WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:01.050
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:01.320 --> 01:03.160
Yo.

3
01:03.160 --> 01:04.960
I'm not Yo.

4
01:04.960 --> 01:07.440
I saw the three of them.

5
01:08.120 --> 01:10.080
They were tortured to death.

6
01:10.080 --> 01:12.120
But what they resent even more is...

7
01:12.120 --> 01:14.880
that their trapped souls can never be reborn.

8
01:14.880 --> 01:16.040
Is there any way to fix this?

9
01:16.040 --> 01:17.280
The three from the past,

10
01:17.280 --> 01:20.520
Lert, Bulan, and Sroi must die.

11
01:20.520 --> 01:22.000
Bitch Bulan killed you!

12
01:22.000 --> 01:24.760
A fool like you is bound to be betrayed.

13
01:24.760 --> 01:25.920
Kadkao!

14
01:25.920 --> 01:29.880
- I'm not Kadkao! - Kadkao... Kadkao...

15
01:29.880 --> 01:32.826
I'm not Kadkao!

16
01:32.826 --> 01:35.760
What happened to you isn't unusual.

17
01:35.760 --> 01:38.093
The spirits are targeting you.

18
01:40.360 --> 01:42.280
But they asked us to help Kadkao.

19
01:42.280 --> 01:43.760
I just went to see Yo.

20
01:43.760 --> 01:45.600
She talked about Kadkao too.

21
01:45.600 --> 01:49.000
It's up to you two now.

22
01:49.000 --> 01:51.746
You must keep your minds strong.

23
01:51.746 --> 01:53.520
But if you want my advice,

24
01:53.520 --> 01:56.763
if it's not your business, stay out of it.

25
01:57.560 --> 02:00.466
That's what you're telling me, right?

26
02:00.466 --> 02:02.160
Even if it is your business,

27
02:02.160 --> 02:04.240
end it while you still can.

28
02:04.240 --> 02:06.050
Yes.

29
02:06.050 --> 02:09.360
The living and the dead should remain apart.

30
02:09.360 --> 02:12.600
Especially vengeful spirits.

31
02:12.600 --> 02:16.550
Their minds are consumed by revenge.

32
02:17.480 --> 02:20.120
I'm worried about you.

33
02:20.120 --> 02:22.496
I'll put an end to it.

34
02:22.496 --> 02:23.840
Make sure you do.

35
02:23.840 --> 02:25.720
Buddhism teaches us to end suffering,

36
02:25.720 --> 02:28.150
not cling to it.

37
02:37.146 --> 02:38.360
[Police]

38
02:38.360 --> 02:40.440
After what happened to you the other day,

39
02:40.440 --> 02:44.880
my friend who's a geospatial analyst sent me these images.

40
02:44.880 --> 02:46.960
Now I'm starting to wonder.

41
02:47.776 --> 02:49.390
Shit!

42
02:50.360 --> 02:55.040
Why do these people look just like Nat's group?

43
02:55.040 --> 02:56.800
And those three look...

44
02:56.800 --> 02:59.280
just like the people I saw the other day.

45
03:00.200 --> 03:01.440
How can I help you?

46
03:01.440 --> 03:03.680
Please help Kadkao.

47
03:04.392 --> 03:05.960
But these aren't real images.

48
03:05.960 --> 03:11.440
My friend used old land records, terrain data, and historical records,

49
03:11.440 --> 03:15.560
then fed the raw data into AI to reconstruct

50
03:15.560 --> 03:19.540
what this area looked like over a hundred years ago.

51
03:20.680 --> 03:21.840
But here's the strange part.

52
03:21.840 --> 03:26.640
None of the raw data described any faces.

53
03:26.640 --> 03:29.613
We didn't even give the AI photos of Nat's group.

54
03:30.800 --> 03:33.653
The AI generated these faces on its own.

55
03:38.200 --> 03:40.053
Can you believe it?

56
03:42.320 --> 03:45.120
When I stare at them long enough,

57
03:45.120 --> 03:48.760
I feel like they're still alive.

58
04:50.275 --> 04:52.775
[Nat]

59
05:13.200 --> 05:14.506
Disgusting!

60
05:29.120 --> 05:31.640
How could you sink this low, Nat?

61
05:50.322 --> 05:52.600
Nat's really stressed out.

62
05:52.600 --> 05:55.040
I'm just being honest.

63
05:55.040 --> 05:59.320
I have no idea how it video-called you.

64
05:59.320 --> 06:01.653
It must've been a ghost.

65
06:02.240 --> 06:04.080
Ghost or human, I don't care.

66
06:04.080 --> 06:06.440
Just tell Nat to come sign the divorce papers.

67
06:22.680 --> 06:25.160
I'd rather die than divorce you.

68
06:25.160 --> 06:27.053
But I'm divorcing you.

69
06:29.200 --> 06:31.891
Nat! Nat! Get off me!

70
06:31.891 --> 06:34.240
No! I love you, Yo.

71
06:34.240 --> 06:36.760
But I don't love you!

72
06:36.760 --> 06:39.153
Get off me... Get off me!

73
06:41.560 --> 06:43.493
Yo!

74
06:47.280 --> 06:50.680
Nat, let me go!

75
06:50.680 --> 06:54.586
Let go... Nat!

76
06:57.240 --> 07:01.760
Yo! Yo, wait!

77
07:04.240 --> 07:06.146
Yo.

78
07:06.720 --> 07:08.546
Yo.

79
07:15.634 --> 07:18.070
I'm tired of it.

80
07:18.070 --> 07:20.108
Every day with Yo is a problem.

81
07:21.414 --> 07:23.600
It's better if she has someone else.

82
07:23.600 --> 07:26.400
If Yo were sweet and easygoing, I wouldn't do anything to her.

83
07:26.400 --> 07:30.440
But if I can't control her, I'll use that guy as leverage.

84
07:30.440 --> 07:31.840
Yo... I...

85
07:31.840 --> 07:34.613
Will you divorce me, or do I have to sue you?

86
07:40.493 --> 07:42.000
Do whatever you want.

87
07:42.000 --> 07:43.886
But I'm telling you,

88
07:43.886 --> 07:46.409
I will never divorce you.

89
07:50.680 --> 07:52.600
Yes, Pete?

90
07:56.200 --> 07:58.914
Yo, can you come to the station right now?

91
07:59.852 --> 08:01.080
What is it?

92
08:01.080 --> 08:02.600
I have a new lead.

93
08:02.600 --> 08:06.280
It's related to what you dreamed about.

94
08:06.280 --> 08:08.520
I want you to see it for yourself.

95
08:08.520 --> 08:10.127
I'll be right there.

96
08:18.475 --> 08:20.920
[Police Station for the People]

97
08:20.920 --> 08:22.613
Pete.

98
08:24.120 --> 08:26.321
Someone's waiting for you out front.

99
08:26.321 --> 08:28.106
Who?

100
08:34.089 --> 08:37.000
- This is a police station! - Good.

101
08:37.000 --> 08:39.785
Then everyone can hear this. Stay away from my wife.

102
08:42.413 --> 08:44.880
Saying that is disrespectful to your wife.

103
08:44.880 --> 08:46.971
I respect my wife.

104
08:46.971 --> 08:49.960
I don't respect a man who goes after her.

105
08:51.000 --> 08:52.680
You just called Yo.

106
08:52.680 --> 08:54.059
Don't deny it.

107
09:02.518 --> 09:05.209
Stay away from my wife.

108
09:05.209 --> 09:07.480
Or I'll beat the hell out of you.

109
09:07.480 --> 09:09.003
Try me.

110
09:18.480 --> 09:21.040
Yo.

111
09:21.040 --> 09:23.026
I'm sorry.

112
09:23.026 --> 09:25.009
He and I just had a fight.

113
09:27.616 --> 09:29.173
Pete.

114
09:30.720 --> 09:32.493
The lady's here.

115
09:33.120 --> 09:34.960
Let's go.

116
09:38.400 --> 09:40.440
This is Aunt Win.

117
09:40.440 --> 09:42.678
She used to live near the great-grandfather's house.

118
09:42.678 --> 09:45.807
Recently, her nephew had a strange dream.

119
09:47.306 --> 09:51.242
My nephew dreamed about three people.

120
09:51.242 --> 09:53.977
They seem to be our ancestors.

121
09:53.977 --> 09:58.000
They told him their souls were trapped.

122
09:58.000 --> 10:01.098
Keng studied art.

123
10:01.098 --> 10:03.386
He drew this.

124
10:18.188 --> 10:20.650
They're exactly like the people I saw in my dreams.

125
10:23.153 --> 10:24.853
Yohd.

126
10:28.960 --> 10:30.315
Pan.

127
10:31.400 --> 10:33.720
We won't try to run away again.

128
10:33.720 --> 10:35.186
Sali.

129
10:43.400 --> 10:46.920
Where is your nephew now?

130
10:46.920 --> 10:49.640
In the hospital.

131
10:49.640 --> 10:52.733
He's suffering from depression.

132
11:25.960 --> 11:28.546
Go see it for yourself...

133
11:28.546 --> 11:30.386
Kadkao.

134
11:32.720 --> 11:35.240
This girl's name is Kadkao, sir.

135
11:35.240 --> 11:38.440
Her parents are addicted to gambling.

136
11:38.440 --> 11:41.200
They owe our gambling house twenty chang.

137
11:41.200 --> 11:43.520
They can't repay the principal.

138
11:44.288 --> 11:47.040
So they gave us their daughter to work off the interest.

139
11:47.846 --> 11:49.600
Come here.

140
12:17.560 --> 12:19.813
Your parents sold you?

141
12:20.600 --> 12:22.704
She's quite pretty.

142
12:25.360 --> 12:27.301
But there's defiance in her eyes.

143
12:28.569 --> 12:30.253
Sroi!

144
12:31.040 --> 12:33.533
Send her to the kitchen.

145
12:33.533 --> 12:36.160
Make her chop wood and carry water.

146
12:36.160 --> 12:38.653
Don't let her come up here.

147
13:03.933 --> 13:06.760
Is there something I can do for you?

148
13:06.760 --> 13:08.680
What brings you down here, my lady?

149
13:08.680 --> 13:13.240
I just came to see if our new debt slave

150
13:13.240 --> 13:17.963
is worth the twenty chang Master paid for her.

151
13:23.884 --> 13:26.510
Palm sugar, cooked down nice and thick...

152
13:27.560 --> 13:30.000
It smells so sweet.

153
13:30.000 --> 13:32.546
Anyone would be tempted to have a taste.

154
14:11.798 --> 14:14.719
I know my place.

155
14:15.640 --> 14:17.520
Good.

156
14:17.520 --> 14:19.907
If you ever forget your place,

157
14:21.228 --> 14:23.520
I won't drip it on your hands.

158
14:24.907 --> 14:27.466
I'll pour it over your face.

159
15:08.680 --> 15:10.906
So I was Kadkao.

160
15:23.880 --> 15:26.906
What about the marital property?

161
15:29.327 --> 15:32.186
He just transferred the house to me.

162
15:36.200 --> 15:38.976
Is this house marital property?

163
15:41.680 --> 15:43.480
No.

164
15:43.480 --> 15:46.666
It was given to you as a gift.

165
15:46.666 --> 15:48.560
What if I want to sell it?

166
15:48.560 --> 15:50.440
I'm afraid you can't.

167
15:51.320 --> 15:52.653
Why not?

168
15:52.653 --> 15:54.890
Because your husband...

169
15:54.890 --> 15:56.080
[Nat Thanahirankit - Life Usufruct]

170
15:56.080 --> 16:00.560
registered a life usufruct on the title deed.

171
16:03.815 --> 16:06.560
What's a life usufruct?

172
16:06.560 --> 16:11.145
It gives him rights over the property for the rest of his life.

173
16:11.145 --> 16:15.920
Even after you divorce, he still has the right to live there

174
16:15.920 --> 16:18.560
or rent the house out.

175
16:18.560 --> 16:25.333
Having your name on the title deed doesn't give you complete control.

176
16:26.760 --> 16:28.760
So there's nothing I can do?

177
16:28.760 --> 16:30.880
If you really want to sell it,

178
16:30.880 --> 16:33.600
you'll have to wait until he dies.

179
16:33.600 --> 16:36.904
Then you'll have full control of the property.

180
16:43.628 --> 16:46.186
I guess I've been a fool again.

181
16:49.107 --> 16:51.520
I think he transferred it to you

182
16:51.520 --> 16:54.426
to show you he was sincere.

183
16:54.426 --> 17:01.560
But he registered a life usufruct to protect his own rights.

184
17:04.157 --> 17:06.693
So you can't force him out.

185
17:08.744 --> 17:10.702
If I can't make him leave,

186
17:12.440 --> 17:14.760
then I'm the one who has to go.

187
17:19.278 --> 17:21.638
[Nat Thanahirankit - Life Usufruct]

188
17:29.000 --> 17:30.976
It's a court summons.

189
17:30.976 --> 17:33.266
Yo is suing you for divorce.

190
18:04.200 --> 18:07.546
Fish rice soup, Yo's favorite.

191
18:07.546 --> 18:09.560
Thank you, Chef.

192
18:11.193 --> 18:13.305
Try it.

193
18:13.305 --> 18:15.200
Thank you.

194
19:04.880 --> 19:06.480
Yo.

195
19:09.520 --> 19:12.610
Sorry to bother you again.

196
19:12.610 --> 19:16.816
Do you know of any place that's not too expensive?

197
19:17.386 --> 19:19.680
You can stay at my place.

198
19:19.680 --> 19:21.964
I'm hardly ever home.

199
19:21.964 --> 19:24.163
I usually sleep at the station.

200
19:29.760 --> 19:31.720
I'd feel bad imposing on you.

201
19:31.720 --> 19:33.706
Not at all.

202
19:37.680 --> 19:39.840
Thank you so much.

203
19:47.280 --> 19:49.386
Here's the house key.

204
19:49.386 --> 19:52.320
I'll call before I come over.

205
19:52.320 --> 19:54.000
Thank you.

206
20:06.280 --> 20:10.400
Why did you do this to me, Nat?

207
20:10.400 --> 20:12.891
I'm sorry, Yo.

208
20:12.891 --> 20:16.480
I promised. I'll be the husband you deserve.

209
20:16.480 --> 20:17.960
Please, don't leave me.

210
20:17.960 --> 20:20.121
Please, don't leave me. I'm begging you.

211
20:20.121 --> 20:22.373
Please...

212
20:29.320 --> 20:32.000
How long do I have to play dumb

213
20:32.000 --> 20:34.160
before you leave her?

214
20:34.160 --> 20:36.280
I have to work with her.

215
20:36.280 --> 20:37.760
What about me?

216
20:37.760 --> 20:39.440
I'm doing all this for you!

217
20:39.440 --> 20:42.811
The more you say that, the more it hurts.

218
20:42.811 --> 20:45.400
Yo, I'm really just working there.

219
20:45.400 --> 20:47.440
I've been working myself to the bone lately.

220
20:47.440 --> 20:49.702
You must know why.

221
21:06.144 --> 21:10.720
Have a drink, Nat. You look really stressed.

222
21:22.556 --> 21:24.826
I don't understand myself.

223
21:26.480 --> 21:28.440
Why do I feel...

224
21:30.000 --> 21:32.346
so heartbroken right now?

225
21:46.339 --> 21:48.733
I'm going home to Yo.

226
21:50.400 --> 21:53.480
And whatever was between the three of us...

227
21:53.480 --> 21:55.560
ends here.

228
22:04.200 --> 22:05.800
I understand.

229
22:08.040 --> 22:10.746
If you love Yo that much,

230
22:11.840 --> 22:13.798
I'll step aside.

231
22:29.320 --> 22:31.107
But before you go,

232
22:32.560 --> 22:35.586
will you have this drink for me?

233
22:35.586 --> 22:38.800
To the love we once shared.

234
22:40.271 --> 22:42.106
I promise...

235
22:43.320 --> 22:45.600
I won't try to hold you back anymore.

236
23:25.680 --> 23:29.600
Thank you for understanding.

237
24:04.960 --> 24:08.040
You think I'd let you go that easily, Nat?

238
24:08.920 --> 24:11.386
You'll never escape from me.

239
24:57.480 --> 24:59.840
I'm still here?

240
24:59.840 --> 25:02.403
You drank a lot last night.

241
25:06.564 --> 25:09.200
Warm ginger tea for your hangover.

242
25:28.065 --> 25:30.600
I think you should divorce Yo peacefully.

243
25:30.600 --> 25:32.600
I told you. I'm not divorcing her.

244
25:33.680 --> 25:38.708
I heard Yo is seeing Pete.

245
25:38.708 --> 25:40.986
Just let her go.

246
25:42.120 --> 25:43.798
No!

247
25:43.798 --> 25:46.240
Now that I know, I definitely won't divorce her.

248
26:02.000 --> 26:07.053
Giving Nat drugs won't hurt him, right?

249
26:08.480 --> 26:10.720
This should be fine.

250
26:27.280 --> 26:29.186
Yo...

251
26:44.840 --> 26:47.173
I'm not letting you go anywhere, Kadkao.

252
26:50.097 --> 26:52.080
Please let me go, Master.

253
26:52.771 --> 26:55.066
I'm only a debt slave.

254
26:56.800 --> 27:01.040
I want you to have only my lady.

255
27:01.040 --> 27:03.280
Then this house will be peaceful.

256
27:07.160 --> 27:08.840
Peaceful?

257
27:08.840 --> 27:11.400
But if I can't have you,

258
27:11.400 --> 27:13.693
I'd be as good as dead.

259
27:16.262 --> 27:18.373
I love you, Kadkao.

260
27:23.000 --> 27:25.093
I love you, Yo.

261
27:29.184 --> 27:31.291
I've given in to you.

262
27:31.291 --> 27:33.533
I've never given in to anyone.

263
27:34.840 --> 27:37.360
You can't do this to me.

264
27:39.078 --> 27:40.813
Do you hear me?

265
27:41.387 --> 27:43.199
I won't accept this.

266
28:07.800 --> 28:11.280
Sorry Nat dragged this out for so long.

267
28:13.160 --> 28:16.389
But he's ready to divorce you now.

268
28:16.389 --> 28:18.573
Then tell him to meet me at the district office.

269
28:20.587 --> 28:23.085
If you don't want to see Nat,

270
28:23.085 --> 28:25.746
you can sign a divorce agreement

271
28:25.746 --> 28:28.057
at any district office.

272
28:28.057 --> 28:30.613
You can register separately so it won't be awkward.

273
28:34.480 --> 28:36.416
Fine by me.

274
28:37.103 --> 28:39.723
Congratulations on your freedom.

275
28:48.280 --> 28:49.919
Wait.

276
28:52.280 --> 28:54.360
Tell Nat to meet me at the district office.

277
28:54.360 --> 28:55.880
Let's get this over with quickly.

278
28:55.880 --> 28:58.613
No need to complicate things with paperwork.

279
28:59.907 --> 29:01.400
Fine.

280
29:17.720 --> 29:23.680
[District Office - Bangkok Metropolitan]

281
29:23.680 --> 29:27.033
Yotaka Thanahirankit.

282
29:27.033 --> 29:28.399
Yes.

283
29:29.948 --> 29:32.560
Nat Thanahirankit.

284
29:35.760 --> 29:39.066
Nat, the officer is asking you.

285
29:41.720 --> 29:43.133
Yes.

286
29:44.271 --> 29:46.600
You don't look well.

287
29:46.600 --> 29:53.826
To register a divorce, both parties must be fully conscious and aware.

288
29:55.280 --> 29:57.280
He's sick.

289
29:57.280 --> 30:01.019
He's been heartbroken and hasn't slept for days.

290
30:01.019 --> 30:03.466
He's devastated about the divorce.

291
30:06.363 --> 30:07.640
Nat.

292
30:07.640 --> 30:11.083
Do you confirm that you're divorcing of your own free will,

293
30:11.083 --> 30:13.910
and no one is forcing you?

294
30:19.200 --> 30:21.055
Yo doesn't love you.

295
30:21.055 --> 30:23.560
Divorce her.

296
30:23.560 --> 30:25.826
Divorce her.

297
30:31.280 --> 30:32.920
I...

298
30:33.840 --> 30:35.280
do.

299
30:37.640 --> 30:43.573
If you've settled the property matters, please sign here.

300
30:45.920 --> 30:48.720
Nat, sign it. Go on.

301
31:22.720 --> 31:25.200
Yotaka, please sign here.

302
31:36.120 --> 31:38.533
Go ahead and sign, Yo.

303
32:01.733 --> 32:03.675
I've changed my mind.

304
32:03.675 --> 32:04.840
I'm not divorcing him.

305
32:04.840 --> 32:06.395
What's wrong with you?

306
32:07.720 --> 32:12.120
Stop. If you can't agree, please settle this outside.

307
32:12.120 --> 32:15.040
Let me know if you change your mind.

308
32:15.040 --> 32:16.502
What a waste of time!

309
32:34.417 --> 32:36.960
Nat looked terrible.

310
32:37.577 --> 32:39.089
He seemed barely conscious.

311
32:39.089 --> 32:42.426
I'm afraid Pam may have drugged him.

312
32:43.040 --> 32:45.120
If Nat really was drugged,

313
32:45.120 --> 32:47.704
this becomes an urgent criminal case,

314
32:47.704 --> 32:50.106
not just a family matter.

315
32:51.640 --> 32:53.806
I'm afraid Pam might take Nat away.

316
32:55.080 --> 32:57.383
I'll keep watch from a distance.

317
32:57.383 --> 33:00.800
If they make a move or I find any evidence,

318
33:00.800 --> 33:02.640
I'll call you right away.

319
33:02.640 --> 33:04.625
Wouldn't it be better if I sent a detective?

320
33:04.625 --> 33:06.733
No.

321
33:06.733 --> 33:08.799
I don't want to make a big deal of it.

322
33:12.709 --> 33:14.493
[Nat]

323
33:22.133 --> 33:23.138
What is it, Nat?

324
33:23.138 --> 33:24.760
I agreed to the divorce.

325
33:24.760 --> 33:26.200
Why wouldn't you go through with it?

326
33:26.200 --> 33:29.973
Because you looked sick. You barely had any strength.

327
33:29.973 --> 33:33.760
I'm fine. Tell me when you're ready to divorce.

328
33:33.760 --> 33:35.640
The sooner, the better.

329
33:35.640 --> 33:38.560
Then I can marry Pam.

330
33:38.560 --> 33:40.333
I love Pam.

331
33:40.333 --> 33:42.000
Do you understand, Yo?

332
33:42.000 --> 33:43.480
If you don't want to see me

333
33:43.480 --> 33:44.920
or Pam,

334
33:44.920 --> 33:47.938
I'll prepare the divorce papers.

335
33:47.938 --> 33:50.640
Sign them whenever you're ready.

336
33:50.640 --> 33:52.813
Then we can finally be done.

337
34:05.040 --> 34:06.506
Are you okay?

338
34:21.440 --> 34:24.480
I think I busted Pam.

339
34:24.480 --> 34:26.466
Busted?

340
35:00.800 --> 35:03.080
Nat,

341
35:03.080 --> 35:05.120
have some water.

342
35:10.120 --> 35:11.759
No.

343
35:33.792 --> 35:37.880
[Nat]

344
35:37.880 --> 35:40.040
[Yo]

345
36:06.235 --> 36:08.093
[Yo]

346
36:08.880 --> 36:10.040
Answer it.

347
36:10.040 --> 36:12.090
[Yo]

348
36:12.090 --> 36:14.733
[This call will be recorded.]

349
36:16.307 --> 36:17.400
Why are you calling?

350
36:17.400 --> 36:19.240
I'm busy. I have to go.

351
36:19.240 --> 36:21.426
Wait, Nat.

352
36:22.320 --> 36:26.920
I'm calling to tell you I've changed my mind about the divorce.

353
36:27.786 --> 36:29.760
So when do you want to divorce?

354
36:31.800 --> 36:33.960
You pick the date.

355
36:35.000 --> 36:37.066
But when we go,

356
36:38.080 --> 36:41.746
could you wear the first outfit I ever bought you?

357
36:42.560 --> 36:44.905
Do it for me one last time.

358
36:48.000 --> 36:50.040
That white shirt.

359
36:50.901 --> 36:52.751
You're so demanding.

360
36:52.751 --> 36:55.626
Fine. I'll wear it.

361
37:00.800 --> 37:04.000
I never bought Nat a white shirt.

362
37:04.000 --> 37:05.870
Got you.

363
37:23.786 --> 37:25.160
Hello, Yo.

364
37:25.160 --> 37:29.056
Pete, I have proof that wasn't Nat I was talking to.

365
37:29.056 --> 37:31.600
It was an AI-cloned voice.

366
37:31.600 --> 37:33.000
Send me the audio file.

367
37:33.000 --> 37:34.240
I'll have it checked.

368
37:34.240 --> 37:35.626
Okay.

369
37:37.675 --> 37:40.120
[Call with Nat]

370
37:40.120 --> 37:43.346
[Share with Pete]

371
38:01.360 --> 38:02.826
Nat!

372
38:05.626 --> 38:07.160
Are you okay?

373
38:10.226 --> 38:11.600
Nat isn't well.

374
38:11.600 --> 38:13.080
I'm taking him to the hospital.

375
38:13.080 --> 38:14.226
Okay.

376
38:32.440 --> 38:35.960
If you know anything else, please give me a call.

377
38:35.960 --> 38:37.560
Sure, sir.

378
38:38.720 --> 38:39.800
[Pol. Maj. Peerawich Sathitpong] [Inspector (Investigation)]

379
38:59.829 --> 39:01.160
Hello?

380
39:01.160 --> 39:04.118
Hello, Officer. I've seen Nat.

381
39:04.118 --> 39:08.400
He doesn't look well, just like you suspected.

382
39:08.400 --> 39:10.200
Where is he now?

383
39:10.200 --> 39:12.560
Pam took him to the hospital.

384
39:12.560 --> 39:14.226
Thank you very much.

385
39:28.840 --> 39:32.230
Why did you bring Nat here?

386
39:40.080 --> 39:42.426
I'm taking him back to his own house.

387
39:43.000 --> 39:46.680
The police and Yo must be looking everywhere for Nat.

388
39:46.680 --> 39:48.866
I'd like to see what happens

389
39:48.866 --> 39:50.720
when they all show up

390
39:50.720 --> 39:54.053
and find Nat sleeping peacefully in his own house.

391
39:55.482 --> 39:58.240
What can they possibly do to us?

392
40:01.200 --> 40:02.920
What's happening?

393
40:03.906 --> 40:05.360
I don't know.

394
40:05.360 --> 40:07.320
Let me try starting it again.

395
40:13.440 --> 40:16.080
Oh! What's wrong with it?

396
40:43.840 --> 40:47.213
We've been waiting so long for all of you.

397
40:59.520 --> 41:00.600
How are you?

398
41:00.600 --> 41:02.240
Fine, I guess.

399
41:02.240 --> 41:04.920
Seeing you cheat on me.

400
41:04.920 --> 41:06.800
You're talking just fine now.

401
41:06.800 --> 41:08.440
Not drowsy or confused anymore?

402
41:08.440 --> 41:11.000
Can I have a strand of your hair for testing?

403
41:11.000 --> 41:12.160
Police!

404
41:12.160 --> 41:14.120
If I keep the precepts and dedicate merit to them,

405
41:14.120 --> 41:16.306
could it lessen the harm to Nat?

406
41:16.306 --> 41:17.520
I love you.

407
41:17.520 --> 41:19.613
I only want to be with you.

408
41:19.613 --> 41:24.440
If Master Lert drinks too much of this, it could kill him.

409
41:24.440 --> 41:26.380
Kadkao! Kadkao!
